# Database dumps, in case one is ever pointed here despite the script refusing
*.dump

# Scratch checkouts of this same repository. Left untracked they are invisible;
# committed, `git add .` records each one as a submodule pointing at a commit
# that exists on nobody else's machine.
.claude/worktrees/

# Kokoro model weights and voice packs. Hundreds of megabytes, fetched per
# docs/kokoro-prototype.md rather than committed.
*.safetensors
voices.npz
